# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Generated run outputs (the example scripts write these to the project root)
#   plots / animations:  planner_result, edge_profile, speed_profiles,
#   pref_examples, route_plane, network, simulation.gif, eecm_*_front, ...
#   solution logs:       eecm_net<NN>_depart<HHMM>_solutions.json
# `/` anchors to the repo root, so dataset/png/*.png is NOT affected.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/*.png
/*.gif
/*.mp4
/eecm_net*.json
/pareto_net*.json

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Fixed 120-network benchmark
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The dataset/ folder is COMMITTED on purpose: it is the fixed, numbered
# reference (001-120), and regenerating it from seeds changes whenever the
# generation code changes -- so the JSON must be pinned in git for reproducible
# results. To slim the repo you may exclude the (regenerable) images instead;
# uncomment the next line and rebuild visuals with `python -m examples.build_dataset`:
# dataset/png/
